{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111920/extras/de2451fa0f3d5cb2922ad008c576eb84.avif?t=1761548626\" width=1560 height=241 /></span>Embark on an adventure to find the magic book!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of monsters will appear to disrupt your adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't worry, the game offers a variety of ways to become more powerful.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are treasures that attack or enhance our abilities.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquired treasures have unique enhancements.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use the unique magic of the spirits you use in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111920/extras/ae675d8a794a874f902835b7226cb606.avif?t=1761548626\" width=1560 height=479 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0You can use magic stones in the library to acquire or enhance useful abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure paths are randomly generated each time you start an adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose a randomly generated path to proceed with your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can experience a fun adventure as you travel through various regions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can acquire spirits using magic stones obtained through adventure. Changing spirits can provide a unique experience in each battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventures offer varying levels of difficulty. As the difficulty increases, various effects are added to make the adventure more challenging, making it a challenging adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on this challenging but fun adventure now!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4111920?t=1761548626","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4111920?t=1761548626","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111920/e620b1c347b42e07f6e262f4e987ced2dd9356e1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761548626","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111920/e620b1c347b42e07f6e262f4e987ced2dd9356e1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761548626","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111920/extras/de2451fa0f3d5cb2922ad008c576eb84.avif?t=1761548626\" width=1560 height=241 /></span>Embark on an adventure to find the magic book!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of monsters will appear to disrupt your adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't worry, the game offers a variety of ways to become more powerful.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are treasures that attack or enhance our abilities.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquired treasures have unique enhancements.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use the unique magic of the spirits you use in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111920/extras/ae675d8a794a874f902835b7226cb606.avif?t=1761548626\" width=1560 height=479 /></span></p><